<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (School of Rock: The Musical is a high-energy, family-friendly rock musical based on the hit film. The show includes mild language, comedic deception, references to strict parenting and school pressure, brief references to alcohol, and loud rock music. It also includes moments of yelling, rebellious behaviour, adults making poor choices for comic effect, and children challenging authority as they learn to express themselves. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
