/P 223 0 R
/E (Lucienne has been taking theatre classes for several years at Theatre Ancaster and Big Hearts, Little Theatre, among others. She is thrilled to be playing Freddie as part of the School of Rock cast. She is an accomplished pianist and is learning to play the french horn and drums. She would like to thank her singing teacher, Cydney London-Speers and her piano teacher, Ania Fritch. She also wants to thank her parents, Heather and Chris, and her brother, Saxon, for their love and support. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
